OL,3,ATwo charged with woman's murder as
OL,4,ASouth Africa police investigate eight
OL,5,Aother body finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo women have been charged in South
OL,8,FAfrica in connection with the murder of
OL,9,Fa woman in an area east of Johannesburg
OL,10,F` the last of nine recent cases in that
OL,11,Fregion that have reignited the debate
OL,12,Fabout the levels of gender-based
OL,13,Fviolence in the country.
OL,15,FUnder pressure to solve the spate of
OL,16,Fmurders which has involved victims'
OL,17,Fbodies being dumped on a roadside,
OL,18,Fpolice have described the arrests of
OL,19,Fthe two as a "breakthrough".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
