OL,3,ATwo charged with woman's murder as
OL,4,ASouth Africa police investigate eight
OL,5,Aother body finds
OL,6,
OL,7,FReferring to all nine cases, acting
OL,8,Fpolice chief Lt Gen Puleng Dimpane said
OL,9,Fher officers were "working tirelessly
OL,10,Fto bring those responsible to justice".
OL,12,FThe two women have been charged with
OL,13,Fpremeditated murder and defeating the
OL,14,Fends of justice.
